1. Yes, i leave a lot of weapons lying around that i don't plan to use
- i  test if weapons are cursed only if i'd like to use them. As for
armor, i try to test most of it. There are ways to make the testing
easier with a pet: limit the amount of spaces the pet can step onto to
maximize the time the pet will step on the armor you want to test. You
can do this by testing in a small room, a corridor, etc. If i've got a
decent piece of armor (+2 or +3) then i won't be crazy about trying
each and every one. But then i'm lazy and maybe that's not a good
idea.

