I always take items that monsters would use, especially if they'd use
it against me. Scrolls, potions, wands, etc. If things start getting
too heavy or my inventory is full, i look to make a stash somewhere in
a box. But yes, i always carry around with me items i think are needed
for survival. I tend to have bad inventory management myself, so i
might not be the best person to comment on this one. I tend to carry
everything i can and border on burdened at all times. Of course, i try
very hard not to be burdened at any time.

> c - I'm not sure if I'm in the main cave or not. Is there any way of
